<!-- First draft. Next up: Second Pass, then scripting and assets. -->
:: Menu_Enter

"What food do we serve here?" {glink: "Menu_Question", label: `${actorOne.name}'s question dislodges your thought.`, lookAt: `e:${actorOne.entity}`}

:: Menu_Question
actorOneQ: `"What should I put on the menu? So far I've been serving burned grits."`
actorOneQ (actorOne.personality === "nerd"): `"Like, I've just been heating up frozen pizza. Is that good enough?"`
actorOneQ (actorOne.personality === "stooge"): `"A customer asked me if we offered anything other than 'ambience and empty plates'.", ${capitalize(actorOne.pronouns.subject)} makes some air quotes, "Is there something else?"`
actorOneQ (actorOne.personality === "goth"): `"I have found it necessary to draw from casks within my private stores, though it seems more equitable if you were to shoulder the burden of menu planning yourself."`
actorOneQ (actorOne.personality === "stoic"): `"I've been dusting crumbs and serving them on plates. That doesn't really seem satisfactory."`
--
{actorOne.name} a little further: {actorOneQ} 

[["Do you have any ideas?"->Menu_Idea]]
[["Give me some crayons, I'll draw the menu."->Menu_Draw]]
[["Just do whatever the customer wants."->Menu_Whatever]]

:: Menu_Idea
actorOneIdea: `"Hear me out: I'm thinking we can have a bunch of staple curries. I just need to buy the right seasonings, and it'll be like an explosion of flavor."`
actorOneIdea (actorOne.personality === "nerd"): `"Pizza."`
actorOneIdea (actorOne.personality === "stooge"): `"I've sampled a lot of custards in my life, and let me say, you can't go wrong with custard."`
actorOneIdea (actorOne.personality === "goth"): `"You can never go wrong with a teahouse. Since we do not appear to have any tea making facilities, I would suggest merely tea sandwiches. Customers can provide their own tea."`
actorOneIdea (actorOne.personality === "stoic"): `"I am a rice fan. Rice goes well with any meal, so it would be possible to serve a local grain of rice on a plate."`
--
{actorOneIdea}

[["Yeah, sounds good."->Menu_Accept]]
[["I don't know if I like that."->Menu_Unsure]]

:: Menu_Unsure
"Then we're back at square one."

[["Tell me your idea again?"->Menu_Idea]]
[["Let me just draw the menu for you."->Menu_Draw]]
[["The customers can starve for all I care."->Menu_Whatever]]

:: Menu_Accept
menu_items: "curries"
menu_items: "pizzas"
menu_items: "custards"
--
{actorOne.name} nods. "Will proceed." {capitalize(actorOne.pronouns.subject)} hangs a menu of select {menu_items} on the wall.

<!-- FINISH -->

:: Menu_Draw

<form id="menu-draw">
<entity-draw id="menu-drawing" required></entity-draw>
<submit-passage-link class="link" to="Menu_Drawn">"Try this."</submit-passage-link>
</form>

:: Menu_Drawn
menu_items: "unknown"
--
"Okay." {actorOne.name} takes the menu and goes to place it on the wall. Turning back to yell at you, {actorOne.pronouns.subject} screams "Not really sure what this says, but I'll just improvise!"

<!-- FINISH -->

:: Menu_Whatever
menu_items: "whatever"
--
"How callous." {actorOne.name} shrugs and slaps an impromptu menu on the wall.

<!-- FINISH -->